{"id":"reference/Floats","kind":"langref","title":"浮点数","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#Floats","file":"reference/Floats.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"Floats","text":"浮点数"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Float-Literals","text":"浮点数字面量"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Floating-Point-Operations","text":"浮点运算"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"Floats\" class=\"chapter-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Floats\">浮点数</a></h2>\n\n      <p>Zig 提供以下浮点类型：</p>\n      <ul>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-type\">f16</span></code> —— IEEE-754-2008 binary16</li>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-type\">f32</span></code> —— IEEE-754-2008 binary32</li>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-type\">f64</span></code> —— IEEE-754-2008 binary64</li>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-type\">f80</span></code> —— IEEE-754-2008 八十位扩展精度</li>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-type\">f128</span></code> —— IEEE-754-2008 binary128</li>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_longdouble</span></code> —— 与目标 C ABI 的 <code class=\"c\">long double</code> 一致</li>\n      </ul>\n      <h3 id=\"Float-Literals\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Float-Literals\">浮点数字面量</a></h3>\n\n      <p>浮点数字面量的类型为 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">comptime_float</span></code>，其精度和运算保证与其他浮点类型中最大的类型 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">f128</span></code> 相同。</p>\n      <p>浮点数字面量可以<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Type-Coercion\">强制转换</a>为任意浮点类型；没有小数部分时，也可以转换为任意<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a>类型。</p>\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">float_literals.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">floating_point</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">123.0E+77</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">another_float</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">123.0</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">yet_another</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">123.0e+77</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">hex_floating_point</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">0x103.70p-5</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">another_hex_float</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">0x103.70</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">yet_another_hex_float</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">0x103.70P-5</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 可以在两个数字之间放置下划线作为视觉分隔符</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">lightspeed</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">299_792_458.000_000</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">nanosecond</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">0.000_000_001</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">more_hex</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">0x1234_5678.9ABC_CDEFp-10</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div></code></pre></figure></div>\n\n      <p>没有表示 NaN、正无穷或负无穷的字面量语法。需要使用标准库获取这些特殊值：</p>\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">float_special_values.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@import</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"std\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">inf</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">math</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">inf</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">f32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">negative_inf</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">math</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">inf</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">f64</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">nan</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">math</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">nan</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">f128</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div></code></pre></figure></div>\n\n      \n      <h3 id=\"Floating-Point-Operations\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Floating-Point-Operations\">浮点运算</a></h3>\n\n      <p>浮点运算默认使用 <code>.strict</code> 模式，但可以按块切换到 <code>.optimized</code> 模式：</p>\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">float_mode_obj.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@import</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"std\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">big</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@as</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">f64</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">&lt;&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">foo_strict</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">f64</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">f64</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">big</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">big</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">foo_optimized</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">f64</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">f64</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@setFloatMode</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">optimized</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">big</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">big</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div></code></pre></figure></div><div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame is-terminal has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">命令行</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"shellsession\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">$ zig build-obj float_mode_obj.zig -O fast</span></div></div>\n</code></pre></figure></div>\n\n      <p>此测试必须将代码分成两个目标文件，否则优化器会在编译时算出所有值，而编译时运算使用严格模式。</p>\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">float_mode_exe.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">print</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@import</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"std\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">debug</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">print</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">extern</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">foo_strict</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">f64</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">f64</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">extern</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">foo_optimized</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">f64</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">f64</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">pub</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">main</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"--0